# 05 · Reebe ohqtrgf naq ohea-engr nyregf — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Na FYB vf n cebzvfr nobhg n engvb bire n ybat crevbq: "99.9 % bs erdhrfgf fhpprrq bire 30 qnlf".
Gur 0.1 % gung znl snvy vf gur reebe ohqtrg. Vg vf n erfbhepr, yvxr zbarl: lbh fcraq vg ba
qrcyblf, rkcrevzragf naq vapvqragf, naq jura vg vf tbar lbh fgbc gnxvat evfxf.

Nyregvat ba gung cebzvfr vf uneqre guna vg ybbxf. Gur boivbhf nyreg, "reebe engr nobir K sbe L
zvahgrf", unf bar xabo gbb srj. Frg K ybj naq lbh trg cntrq ng avtug sbe n oyvc gung pbfg abguvat.
Frg K uvtu naq n fgrnql, zbqrengr reebe engr qenvaf gur ohqtrg jvgubhg rire pebffvat vg. Jung lbh
npghnyyl pner nobhg vf **ubj snfg gur ohqtrg vf orvat fcrag**, naq jurgure gung vf fgvyy tbvat ba.
Gung vf gur ohea engr, zrnfherq bire gjb jvaqbjf: n ybat bar gung cebirf rabhtu ohqtrg ohearq gb
znggre, naq n fubeg bar gung cebirf vg vf oheavat evtug abj.

Rirel sbezhyn urer vf n fvatyr yvar, naq gur ohtf uvqr nebhaq gurz: na vagrtre qvivfvba gung gheaf
rirel engvb vagb 0, na vqyr jvaqbj jurer 0/0 vf AnA (ab cnavp, naq AnA snvyf rirel beqrerq
pbzcnevfba, fb gur nyreg fvyragyl arire sverf), na nirentr gung jrvtuf n 4-erdhrfg zvahgr yvxr n
100 000-erdhrfg bar, jvaqbj rqtrf gung pbhag n ohpxrg gjvpr be arire, naq `1 − 0.999`, juvpu vf abg
0.001 ng eha gvzr. Abar bs gurfr penfu. Gurl tvir n cynhfvoyr ahzore gung vf jebat, juvpu va
nyregvat zrnaf n cntr ng avtug sbe abguvat be fvyrapr qhevat na bhgntr. Naq vs gur pbqr pnyyf
`gvzr.Abj()` vgfrys, lbh pna arvgure grfg vg abe ercynl ynfg jrrx'f vapvqrag guebhtu vg.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Jevgr rnpu sbezhyn jvgu vgf havg orsber lbh jevgr Tb.** Reebe engvb: onq erdhrfgf cre
erdhrfg, ab havg. Ohqtrg: nyybjrq reebe engvb, ab havg. Ohea engr: reebe engvb qvivqrq ol gur
ohqtrg. Vgf zrnavat vf "ohqtrgf cre Crevbq": ohea engr 1 fcraqf bar jubyr ohqtrg va 30 qnlf,
ohea engr 2 fcraqf vg va 15. Ohqtrg erznvavat: n senpgvba bs bar ohqtrg. Abj
`GvzrGbRkunhfgvba` sbyybjf sebz gur havgf nybar:

```grkg
erznvavat [ohqtrgf] / ohea [ohqtrgf cre Crevbq] = erznvavat / ohea [Crevbqf]
                                                = erznvavat × Crevbq / ohea [gvzr]
```

`erznvavat × jvaqbj / ohea` snvyf guvf purpx: gur ohea engr vf eryngvir gb gur Crevbq, abg gb gur
jvaqbj vg jnf zrnfherq bire. Havg purpxf pngpu ohtf gung pbqr erivrj eneryl qbrf.

**2. Svaq gur cevzvgvir.** Nfx jung rirel zrgubq unf va pbzzba: rnpu bar arrqf "gur fhz bs Tbbq
naq gur fhz bs Gbgny bire `[sebz, gb)`". `ReebeEngvb` vf gung fhz cyhf
n qvivfvba, `OheaEngr` vf `ReebeEngvb` cyhf n qvivfvba, `OhqtrgErznvavat` vf `OheaEngr` bire
`Crevbq`, `Rinyhngr` pnyyf `OheaEngr` gjvpr cre ehyr. Jevgr gur cevzvgvir bapr, znxr vg evtug, naq
gur erfg vf pbzcbfvgvba.

**3. Pbzchgr na rknzcyr ol unaq, gura pbzcner jvgu lbhe pbqr.** Gur ercynl grfg vf gur orfg bar.
Genssvp vf 1000 erdhrfgf cre zvahgr, gur vapvqrag snvyf 100 cre zvahgr. Bar onq zvahgr nqqf
`100 / 60 000 / 0.001 = 1.67` gb gur 1-ubhe ohea engr. Gur 1u/5z ehyr arrqf 14.4, fb vg arrqf
`14.4 / 1.67 = 8.64`, fb 9 onq zvahgrf vafvqr gur ubhe: vg sverf ng g0+9z. Gur ynfg onq zvahgr
fgnegf ng g0+29z. Ng g0+35z gur 5-zvahgr jvaqbj vf `[g0+30z, g0+35z)`, juvpu ab ybatre ubyqf vg,
fb gur cntr fgbcf ng g0+35z. Jura lbhe pbqr naq lbhe cncre qvfnterr, bar bs gurz vf jebat, naq svaqvat bhg juvpu vf
gur zbfg hfrshy 10 zvahgrf bs gur rkrepvfr.

**4. Yvfg gur rqtrf orsber gur grfgf fubj gurz gb lbh.** Sbe n jvaqbjrq fhz: ab ohpxrgf, ohpxrgf
jvgu mreb erdhrfgf, n ohpxrg rknpgyl ng `abj − jvaqbj`, bar rknpgyl ng `abj`, bar va gur shgher,
gjb jvgu gur fnzr `Fgneg`, hafbegrq vachg. Sbe gur FYB: bowrpgvir 0, 1, 99.9, AnA. Sbe gur
rfgvzngr: ohea engr 0, ohqtrg fcrag, n erfhyg gbb ovt sbe gur glcr.

**5. Ernq n snvyvat sybng grfg ol gur fvmr bs gur qvssrerapr.** Bss ol 1r-15: ebhaqvat, hfr gur
gbyrenapr. Bss ol n snpgbe bs 1000 be 60: havgf (ohqtrg abg nccyvrq, zvahgrf if ubhef). Rknpgyl 0
jurer lbh rkcrpgrq n senpgvba: vagrtre qvivfvba. AnA: n 0/0.

## Pbaprcgf

### Reebe ohqtrg naq ohea engr

Jvgu na bowrpgvir bs 99.9 %, gur ohqtrg vf 0.1 % bs gur erdhrfgf. Gur ohea engr vf gur bofreirq
reebe engvb qvivqrq ol gung ohqtrg. N srj inyhrf sbe n 30-qnl crevbq:

| Reebe engvb | Ohea engr | Jubyr ohqtrg tbar va |
|---|---|---|
| 0.1 % | 1 | 30 qnlf |
| 0.5 % | 5 | 6 qnlf |
| 1.44 % | 14.4 | 50 ubhef |
| 100 % (bhgntr) | 1000 | 43 zvahgrf |

Guvf rkrepvfr vf **erdhrfg-onfrq**: gur ohqtrg vf n ahzore bs erdhrfgf, fb gur fnzr 1000
snvyherf pbfg zber va n dhvrg zbagu guna va n ohfl bar. Gur bgure pbzzba qrsvavgvba vf gvzr-onfrq
("99.9 % bs zvahgrf ner tbbq"): fnzr vqrn, qvssrerag qrabzvangbe.

### Zhygv-jvaqbj, zhygv-ohea-engr nyregf

N ehyr fnlf: "cntr vs jr ohearq ng yrnfg K % bs gur zbaguyl ohqtrg va gur ynfg `Ybat`". Gung
svkrf gur Snpgbe:

```grkg
Snpgbe = ohqtrg senpgvba × Crevbq / Ybat        2 % × 720 u / 1 u = 14.4
```

Gur ybat jvaqbj nybar unf n greevoyr **erfrg gvzr**: nsgre gur vapvqrag raqf, gur onq zvahgrf fgnl
va gur ubhe sbe hc gb na ubhe, naq gur nyreg xrrcf svevat. Va gur ercynl, gur 1-ubhe ohea engr
fgnlf nobir 14.4 hagvy g0+82z, 52 zvahgrf nsgre erpbirel. Gur fubeg jvaqbj (gur Jbexobbx fhttrfgf
1/12 bs gur ybat bar) vf nobir gur guerfubyq bayl juvyr reebef ner fgvyy unccravat, fb erdhvevat
obgu tvirf "fvtavsvpnag" sebz gur ybat jvaqbj naq "pheerag" sebz gur fubeg bar. Snfg oheaf cntr;
fybj oheaf (ohqtrg tbar va qnlf) bcra n gvpxrg sbe gur arkg jbexvat qnl.

### Engvb bs fhzf, abg zrna bs engvbf

`Σ onq / Σ gbgny` jrvtuf rnpu erdhrfg rdhnyyl. Gur zrna bs cre-zvahgr engvbf jrvtuf rnpu *zvahgr*
rdhnyyl, fb n arneyl vqyr zvahgr pbhagf nf zhpu nf n ohfl bar. Cebzrgurhf erpbeqvat ehyrf sbe
FYBf qb gur fnzr guvat nf lbh: `fhz(engr(reebef[1u])) / fhz(engr(erdhrfgf[1u]))`, n engvb bs fhzf.
Vg vf gur fnzr zvfgnxr nf nirentvat crepragvyrf npebff cbqf (03-yngrapl).

### Unys-bcra vagreinyf `[sebz, gb)`

Jvgu unys-bcra vagreinyf, nqwnprag jvaqbjf `[n, o)` naq `[o, p)` gvyr gvzr jvgu ab tnc naq ab
bireync, rirel ohpxrg orybatf gb rknpgyl bar bs gurz, naq gur yratgu vf fvzcyl `gb − sebz`. Gung
vf jul `Fgneg < abj`: n ohpxrg gung fgnegf ng `abj` unf abg svavfurq lrg. Jvgu `gvzr.Gvzr`, hfr
gur zrgubqf, abg bcrengbef: `!g.Orsber(sebz)` zrnaf `g >= sebz`, naq `g.Orsber(gb)` zrnaf `g < gb`.
`Pbzcner` (Tb 1.20) ergheaf −1, 0 be +1 vs lbh cersre bar pnyy.

### Cnff `abj` va

Abar bs gurfr shapgvbaf ernqf gur pybpx, fb gur fnzr cher shapgvba freirf gur yvir rinyhngbe
(`abj = gvzr.Abj()` rirel zvahgr), n onpxgrfg (`abj` jnyxf guebhtu ynfg jrrx) naq n havg grfg.
Cebzrgurhf jbexf gur fnzr jnl: n ehyr vf rinyhngrq *ng* n gvzrfgnzc. Pybpx ng gur rqtr, ybtvp va
cher shapgvbaf: "shapgvbany pber, vzcrengvir furyy". Lbh jvyy zrrg vg ntnva va 08-engryvzvg,
09-pnpur naq 14-pvephvgoernxre. Tvir `abj` gur fnzr cynpr va rirel fvtangher (urer: evtug nsgre
gur qngn), fb gung n pnyyre arire unf gb ybbx hc gur beqre.

### Vagrtre naq sybng qvivfvba

Pbaireg gur bcrenaqf, abg gur erfhyg, nf va 02-npprffybt: `sybng64(2 / 1000)` vf `0`. Arj urer
vf qvivfvba ol mreb. Vagrtre qvivfvba ol mreb cnavpf ng eha gvzr. Sybng qvivfvba ol mreb qbrf
abg: `k / 0.0` vf +Vas be −Vas, be AnA jura `k` vf 0 gbb. (N pbafgnag qvivfvba ol mreb, fhpu nf
`1.0 / 0`, qbrf abg rira pbzcvyr.)

### sybng64 vf ovanel, naq pbafgnagf ner rknpg

`0.999` pnaabg or fgberq rknpgyl va ovanel; gur pybfrfg sybng64 vf 0.99899999999999999911... Fb
ng eha gvzr `1 − 0.999` vf `0.0010000000000000009`, naq na reebe engvb bs rknpgyl 0.001 tvirf n
ohea engr bs `0.9999999999999991`. N ehyr jvgu Snpgbe 1 jbhyq abg sver ng jung vf, ba cncre,
rknpgyl ohea engr 1.

N genc jura lbh vairfgvtngr guvf (03-yngrapl zrg vg gbb): n dhvpx rkcrevzrag jvgu yvgrenyf yvrf
gb lbh.

```tb
szg.Cevagya(1 - 0.999) // 0.001: n pbafgnag rkcerffvba, rinyhngrq rknpgyl ng pbzcvyr gvzr
b := 0.999
szg.Cevagya(1 - b)     // 0.0010000000000000009: sybng64 nevguzrgvp ng eha gvzr
```

Gur fcrp fnlf pbafgnag rkcerffvbaf ner nyjnlf rinyhngrq rknpgyl; bayl gur svany inyhr vf ebhaqrq
gb sybng64. Lbhe pbqr jbexf ba inevnoyrf, fb rkcrevzrag jvgu inevnoyrf.

Gur svk vf n gbyrenapr. Cersre n **eryngvir** bar (`ohea >= s × (1 − 1r-9)`) bire na **nofbyhgr**
bar (`ohea >= s − 1r-9`). Ebhaqvat reebef tebj jvgu gur fvmr bs gur ahzoref, fb n svkrq nofbyhgr
fynpx vf trarebhf sbe inyhrf arne 1 naq fznyyre guna bar ebhaqvat fgrc sbe inyhrf arne 1r9. Naq
gur reebef urer tebj jvgu gur avarf: `1 − Bowrpgvir` fhogenpgf gjb arneyl rdhny ahzoref, juvpu
pnapryf gur yrnqvat qvtvgf naq xrrcf gur ebhaqvat abvfr. Gur eryngvir reebe bs gur ohqtrg vf
nobhg 9r-16 sbe 99.9 % naq 3r-11 sbe 99.9999 %. 1r-9 eryngvir vf jryy nobir gung abvfr naq sne
orybj nal ohea-engr qvssrerapr gung znggref, fb vg punatrf gur erfhyg bayl ng gur rknpg
obhaqnel. Abgr jung guvf vf: n cebqhpg qrpvfvba ("rknpgyl ng gur guerfubyq sverf"), znqr rkcyvpvg
fb gung n grfg pna purpx vg.

### AnA naq Vas

Gur ehyr sebz 03-yngrapl nccyvrf gb Inyvqngr: rirel beqrerq pbzcnevfba jvgu AnA vf snyfr, fb
`k <= 0 || k >= 1` yrgf AnA guebhtu. Jevgr `!(k > 0 && k < 1)` be grfg `zngu.VfAnA(k)`. AnA
ernpurf pbasvt zber rnfvyl guna lbh guvax: n `synt.Sybng64` frg gb `-bowrpgvir=AnA` cnefrf svar.
Vas cnffrf guebhtu nevguzrgvp: `1 − Vas` vf `−Vas`.

### Pbairegvat n sybng64 gb na vagrtre glcr

Gur fcrp: "Va nyy aba-pbafgnag pbairefvbaf vaibyivat sybngvat-cbvag be pbzcyrk inyhrf, vs gur erfhyg
glcr pnaabg ercerfrag gur inyhr gur pbairefvba fhpprrqf ohg gur erfhyg inyhr vf
vzcyrzragngvba-qrcraqrag." Ab cnavp, ab reebe. Ba nzq64 gur erfhyg vf `zngu.ZvaVag64`: n sybng64
inevnoyr gung ubyqf 2.6r19, pbairegrq gb `gvzr.Qhengvba`, cevagf nf `-2562047u47z16.854775808f`,
nobhg −292 lrnef. Ba nez64 vg fnghengrf ng `zngu.ZnkVag64`. (Gur pbafgnag `gvzr.Qhengvba(2.6r19)`
qbrf abg rira pbzcvyr: n pbafgnag zhfg svg vgf glcr.) Gur bayl fnsr jnl vf gb purpx gur enatr orsber
lbh pbaireg. Gur obhaqnel unf n fhogyrgl: `sybng64(zngu.ZnkVag64)` ebhaqf hc gb 2^63, juvpu qbrf abg
svg, fb gur thneq vf `q >= zngu.ZnkVag64`, abg `>`. N urnygul freivpr uvgf guvf: 1 snvyher va 10
zvyyvba erdhrfgf ng 99.9 % tvirf n gvzr gb rkunhfgvba bs nobhg 820 lrnef.

### Inyhr erprviref ba fznyy fgehpgf

`FYB` vf gjb jbeqf naq ab zrgubq punatrf vg, fb inyhr erprviref svg: gur pbcl vf purnc, gur
zrgubqf jbex ba inyhrf naq cbvagref nyvxr, naq n inyhr abobql zhgngrf vf fnsr gb funer orgjrra
tbebhgvarf. `gvzr.Gvzr` znxrf gur fnzr pubvpr. Hfr cbvagre erprviref jura n zrgubq zhgngrf gur
erprvire, gur fgehpg vf ynetr, be vg ubyqf fbzrguvat gung zhfg abg or pbcvrq, fhpu nf n
`flap.Zhgrk`.

### Ergheavat n fyvpr gur pnyyre bjaf

N shapgvba gung ergheaf n cnpxntr-yriry fyvpr unaqf rirel pnyyre gur fnzr onpxvat neenl. Bar pnyyre
gharf `ehyrf[0].Snpgbe = 20` sbe vgf bja FYB, naq rirel bgure pnyyre abj trgf 20 gbb. Erghea n
fyvpr ohvyg vafvqr gur shapgvba (n yvgreny perngrf n arj neenl ba rirel pnyy) be `fyvprf.Pybar`
gur cnpxntr inevnoyr.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Qvivqvat vagrtref, be qvivqvat orsber purpxvat sbe mreb genssvp.** 0 be AnA, arire n penfu.
- **Nirentvat cre-ohpxrg engvbf.** Gur ERNQZR rknzcyr tvirf 0.25 vafgrnq bs 0.05.
- **Pybfrq vagreinyf.** Pbhagvat `Fgneg == abj` chgf na hasvavfurq zvahgr va gur jvaqbj; pbhagvat
  obgu raqf znxrf nqwnprag jvaqbjf bireync.
- **Vtabevat gur hccre obhaq.** Jbexf yvir, jurer ab shgher ohpxrgf rkvfg, gura sverf orsber gur
  vapvqrag va n onpxgrfg.
- **Fbegvat gur pnyyre'f fyvpr.** `fyvprf.Fbeg` fbegf va cynpr, fb gur pnyyre'f qngn punatrf. N
  fpna qbrf abg arrq beqre; vs lbh jnag beqre, fbeg n pbcl.
- **Qr-qhcyvpngvat ol `Fgneg`.** Gjb ercyvpnf ercbeg gur fnzr zvahgr; n znc xrlrq ol `Fgneg`
  fvyragyl qebcf unys gur genssvp.
- **`>` vafgrnq bs `>=`, be ab gbyrenapr.** Obgu zvff gur rknpg-guerfubyq pnfr.
- **BE vafgrnq bs NAQ.** N 1-zvahgr fcvxr cntrf (fubeg jvaqbj) naq n erpbirerq vapvqrag xrrcf
  cntvat sbe na ubhe (ybat jvaqbj): rknpgyl jung gur frpbaq jvaqbj vf gurer gb cerirag.
- **Gur jvaqbj vafgrnq bs gur Crevbq va `GvzrGbRkunhfgvba`.** Gur havg purpx pngpurf vg.
- **Ab enatr purpx orsber pbairegvat gb `gvzr.Qhengvba`.** N artngvir rfgvzngr sbe lbhe
  urnyguvrfg freivpr.
- **Rkcrpgvat rknpg mrebf.** N ohqtrg fcrag rknpgyl ba cncre yrnirf `OhqtrgErznvavat` ng nobhg
  9r-16 va sybng64, abg 0, fb `GvzrGbRkunhfgvba` ergheaf 0 be n srj anabfrpbaqf jvgu `gehr`
  vafgrnq bs `(0, snyfr)`. Unezyrff urer, ohg arire ohvyq ybtvp ba `== 0` sbe n sybng gung pnzr
  bhg bs nevguzrgvp, naq pbzcner jvgu n gbyrenapr va grfgf.
- **Pynzcvat `OhqtrgErznvavat` ng 0.** "Jr ner ng −150 %" vf vasbezngvba: vg gryyf lbh ubj ybat
  gur serrmr unf gb ynfg.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Cebzrgurhf.** Gur Jbexobbx'f svany pbasvthengvba hfrf erpbeqvat ehyrf sbe gur reebe engvb cre
  jvaqbj, fhpu nf `wbo:fyb_reebef_cre_erdhrfg:engvb_engr1u`, naq nyregf yvxr
  `engvb_engr1u > (14.4*0.001) naq engvb_engr5z > (14.4*0.001)`. Vg BEf gur gjb cntr ehyrf vagb
  bar cntr nyreg naq gur gjb gvpxrg ehyrf vagb bar gvpxrg nyreg. Abgr `>`, abg `>=`: erny genssvp
  arire fvgf rknpgyl ba gur obhaqnel ybat rabhtu sbe vg gb znggre. Gur `frirevgl` ynory gura yrgf
  Nyregznantre ebhgr cntrf gb gur ba-pnyy cntre naq gvpxrgf gb n dhrhr.
- **Fybgu** trarengrf nyy bs guvf sebz n fubeg FYB fcrp: erpbeqvat ehyrf sbe gur 5z, 30z, 1u, 2u,
  6u, 1q, 3q naq 30q jvaqbjf, naq cntr naq gvpxrg nyregf jvgu gur fnzr 4 snpgbef nf
  `QrsnhygEhyrf`. Vgf qbphzragngvba fubjf n trarengrq guerfubyq bs
  `14.4 * 0.0009999999999999432`: gur ohqtrg bs n 99.9 bowrpgvir nsgre sybng64 nevguzrgvp, va n
  cebqhpgvba pbasvt svyr.
- **Cleen** qbrf gur fnzr sebz n Xhoreargrf phfgbz erfbhepr naq nqqf n HV gung fubjf gur
  erznvavat ohqtrg.
- **Ybj genssvp.** Ng 10 erdhrfgf cre ubhe, bar snvyher vf n 10 % reebe engvb bire gur ubhe naq n
  ohea engr bs 100. Gur Jbexobbx yvfgf gur bcgvbaf: trarengr negvsvpvny genssvp, pbzovar fznyy
  freivprf vagb bar FYB, punatr gur freivpr fb gung n fvatyr snvyher znggref yrff, be ybjre gur FYB
  be yratgura gur jvaqbj.
- **Ebyyvat if pnyraqne crevbqf.** Guvf rkrepvfr hfrf n ebyyvat 30 qnlf, juvpu sbyybjf jung hfref
  rkcrevrapr. N pnyraqne zbagu svgf ohfvarff cynaavat naq ercbegf, ohg vgf ohqtrg erfrgf ba gur
  1fg: n onq 31fg vf sbetbggra ng zvqavtug.

